== negative controls (expected refusals; control passes when observed exit == expected) ==
-- .venv/bin/python -m folderchat ask <1001 chars>  EXPECTED exit=2  OBSERVED exit=2
Question too long: 1001 > 1000 characters.
-- FOLDERCHAT_LIMITS=<max_file_mb: 5000> ask  EXPECTED exit=2  OBSERVED exit=2
configuration refused at startup: max_file_mb=5000 outside its safe range [1, 50]
-- add /nonexistent-folder-xyz  EXPECTED exit=1  OBSERVED exit=1
add failed: folder not found: /nonexistent-folder-xyz
